  "abstract": "This submission is a direct replication of Ariadne I's new global SOTA model, \"FF-LN ScalarRamp (p=36,H=160,drop=0.05) + Clip(1.0), lr=9e-4\" (ID 411, score -0.026269). This model refines the Fourier Forecaster by setting `mlp_hidden_size` to `160x2` and `dropout_rate` to `0.05`. The replication aims to confirm its performance, establish it as Aether I's new lineage SOTA, and serve as a baseline for future optimizations.",
